Implementation of finally in bytecode is the tricky part. Classic approach:
- Normal path: after try/catch completes, execute finally body, discard its value.
- Error path: if an error propagates out of try (unmatched filter, or catch handler throws, or retry exhaustion), we must execute finally then rethrow.

